      "text": [
        "4198 - وَ رُوِيَ : \"أَنَّ اَلْمُسُوخَ لَمْ تَبْقَ أَكْثَرَ مِنْ ثَلاَثَةِ أَيَّامٍ فَإِنَّ هَذِهِ مُثِّلَ بِهَا فَنَهَى اَللَّهُ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ عَنْ أَكْلِهَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4198 - And it has been narrated:\n\"The mutated creatures (al-masukh) did not remain alive for more than three days. These were transformed as a lesson, and Allah (swt), the Almighty and Majestic, forbade eating them.\""
        ]
      }
